### GET All
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/FootballPlayers
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### GET first one
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/FootballPlayers/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### GET by Age Range
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/FootballPlayers/age/25/30
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json


### GET by Team
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/FootballPlayers/team/FC Barcelona
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### GET by Country
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/FootballPlayers/country/Poland
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json